<title>USA: Joilet, Ill., won by Compass Bank.</title>
<headline>Joilet, Ill., won by Compass Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compass Bank said it won $8.345 million of Joilet, Ill., general obligation refunding bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.262177 percent.</p>
</text>
